# AI, ML & Computer Vision Standards

- **Pose Tracking:** MediaPipe Pose / MoveNet Lightning for client real-time; MoveNet Thunder / OpenPose for high-accuracy offline analysis.
- **Rep Counting:** Implement deterministic state machines (e.g., squat: Top ➔ Descending ➔ Bottom ➔ Ascending ➔ Rep Complete) with temporal smoothing.
- **Voice Pipeline:** OpenAI Whisper (STT) + ElevenLabs (TTS). Target latency < 800ms end-to-end.
- **LLM Guardrails:** All agent outputs consumed by the application must use strict structured JSON mode. All prompts must be externally versioned and stored in database/config.
- **Fallbacks:** Every ML service must have a deterministic rule-based fallback when the model or service is unavailable.
